000200 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
000300 PROGRAM-ID.          TQTYEDIT.
000400 AUTHOR.              C HILLES.
000500 DATE-WRITTEN.        7/1/83.
000600 DATE-COMPILED.
000700*INSTALLATION.        GOODYEAR TIRE AND RUBBER - AKRON.
000800*SECURITY.
000900*REMARKS.
001000*C
001100*C   ON OCT 8, 1984, CHANGED THIS SUBPROGRAM AS PART OF THE
001200*C   COMBINATION OF AKRON VERSION AND PLANT VERSION OF STORES
001300*C   PROGRAMS.  SINCE THE AKRON VERSION ALLOWS ENTRY OF
001400*C   IT, J, AND Z BILLS, MATERIAL TRANSFERS, AND SPECIAL
001500*C   STATIONERY ISSUES USING THE WORKORDER FIELD, WE HAVE TO
001600*C   SKIP THE QUANTITY CHECK FOR ITEMS RETURNED AGAINST A WORKORDER
001700*C   IF THESE ARE USED.  SO FOR THESE J, IT, Z, MT, ETC ENTRIES
001800*C   WE DONT DO A WORKORDER QUANTITY CHECK ON RETURNS.
001900*C   NOTE:  AN ACTUAL WORKORDER AT THE PLANTS WILL NEVER APPEAR
002000*C   IN ANY OF THE ABOVE FORMATS. CIH.
002100*C
002200*C   10/10/85  CHANGED PROGRAM TO BE COMPATIBLE WITH THE
002300*C             NATIVE LANGUAGE SUPPORT FACILITY.
002400*C                                         PD RAGLOW.
      *C
      *C   OCT 25, 1994   WL MCINTYRE    REQ: 94-027
      *C   ADDED CODE SO THAT UNIT AND VALUE LIMIT CHECKS WILL BE
      *C   PERFORMED ON STOREROOM RETURNS IF THIS FUNCTIONALITY HAS
      *C   BEEN SPECIFIED BY PLANT USER OPTIONS IN MPLTINFO.
      *C
      *C   FEB 27, 1995   WL MCINTYRE    REQ: 94-027
      *C   ADDED CODE TO ACCOMODATE CHANGE TO MPLTINFO FIELDS THAT
      *C   ALLOWS USER TO SEPARATELY SPECIFY THE USE OF LIMITS FOR
      *C   UNIT AND MONETARY VALUES.
      *C
      *C   MAY 31, 1995   JEFF BUNGO     REQ #94-058
      *C   WHEN A WITHDRAWAL FAILS DUE TO INSUFFICIENT ONHAND,
      *C   WRITE A RECORD TO DSTRWITH (CS5900) WITH THE WITHDRAWAL
      *C   AND CURRENT STOREROOM VALUES TO BE USED ON A REPORT
      *C   TO INDICATE STOREROOM SATISFACTION.
002500*C
      *C   JUNE 13, 1996  JEFF BUNGO
      *C   EXPAND DATE FIELDS FOR YEAR 2000 COMPLIANCE.
      *C   RECOMPILE PROGRAM TO PICK UP NEW FILE FORMATS.
      *C
      *C   MAY 1, 1997    JEFF BUNGO
      *C   ADD EDIT FOR FRANCHISE OWNED CODES TO FORCE WITHDRAWAL
      *C   FROM GOODYEAR OWNED BINS FIRST BEFORE ISSUING FROM
      *C   THE FRANCHISE OWNED BINS.  NEW PARMS PASSED ARE
      *C   THE BIN OWNERS IN THE DISPLAY FIELDS AND CODE OWNER.
      *C
      *C   MAY 12, 1997  JEFF BUNGO
      *C   ADD EDIT TO FORCE RETURNS TO GOODYEAR OWNED BINS ONLY.
002600*C
      *C  11/25/97    JEFF BUNGO   REQ #97-017
      *C     ADD USAGE FIELDS FOR DIRECT DELIVERY.  DD USAGE
      *C     TO BE STORED IN ADDITIONAL FIELD AND TOTAL USAGE.
      *C     STORE ISSUE USAGE CALCULATED BY TOTAL USAGE - DD USAGE.
      *C
      *C  07/15/2003  BRUCE GEISER
      *C     SWITCH LOGIC TO PULL FROM FRANCHISE OWNED BINS FIRST
      *C     THEN GOODYEAR BINS. THIS IS TO ALLOW DANVILLE TO DRAIN
      *C     THE FRANCHISED BINS SO THEY CAN END THE FRANCHISE CONTRACT
      *C     WITH ISC AS PART OF THE ARIBIA PROJECT.
      *C

