      *---5/2/97, JSB HOLDING AREA FOR FRANCHISERS
       01  FRAN-TABLE.
           05  FRAN-ENTRY OCCURS 4 TIMES INDEXED BY FRAN-IDX.
               10  FRAN-ID             PIC X(1).
